{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":15,"creatorName":"Dario Amodei","creatorHandle":"DarioAmodei","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":639380,"authorHandle":"DarioAmodei","authorUserId":"874126509245476864","authorName":"Dario Amodei","authorFollowersObserved":640368,"authorFollowingObserved":0,"authorPostsObserved":23,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_replies_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:30:40.003Z","id":"2088758819304443967","postType":"reply","text":"2/2 Second, on the messaging around AI.  I do not agree that my messaging has been disproportionately negative.  In fact it has been about equally balanced between risks and benefits: I’ve written one major essay about each, and even in interviews where I discuss the risks, I make sure to frequently mention the incredible benefits as well as proposing possible solutions to the risks (short clips from my interviews that end up on social media tend to be disproportionately negative, as that gets clicks).  In fact, I wrote Machines of Loving Grace because I didn’t feel the AI industry was painting an inspiring enough picture of how the technology could radically transform the world for the better.  The bulk of the essay is devoted to refuting skepticism of AI’s potential in health and biology, and showing why I think it will actually be possible to cure most human disease in ~5-10 years, as crazy as it may sound to ordinary people and frankly to biologists as well (I used to be one!).  And, if you read my most recent essay (Policy on the AI Exponential), I discuss concrete proposals for how to streamline the FDA process to make sure the deluge of AI-accelerated drugs isn’t slowed down by the regulatory process.  I feel the urgency here: I lost my father to Hepatitis C only a few years before the development of direct-acting antivirals (sofosbuvir), which cure 95% of patients and probably would have cured him.\n\nI do agree that the public has a negative view of AI (and that this is a big problem), but I don’t think it is primarily caused by me or any other AI leader warning about AI’s risks.  I think it is fundamentally a crisis of trust.  I think that ordinary people don’t trust companies, governments, or the tech industry and always suspect that we are cooking up some new way to screw them over.  The causes of this go back decades and AI is just the latest iteration of it.  I don’t think that a glitzy marketing campaign with a positive spin (which some have advocated that Anthropic do) is the way to win back that trust — at this point, saying that AI will cure cancer is more a cliche than it is inspiring, and most people think it is deceptive.  The thing that will work is *actually curing cancer*.  I think by far the most accurate criticism of AI companies including Anthropic is that we haven’t yet delivered on our big promises to benefit the world.  That is totally on us, and I think it’s the criticism you should be making, instead of all this stuff about messaging and marketing.\n\nWe are however doing our best to fix this: Anthropic is ramping up its efforts very quickly in biology and medicine, and we hope to have incredible results in the coming years and some early glimmers in the coming months.  When we’ve actually accomplished something real, the whole world will hear about it, as loudly as possible, you have my word on that.  But until then I don’t want to make empty promises, and in the meantime I feel compelled to speak honestly about the very real risks of AI and how to address them.  Honesty is the right thing on the merits, and in terms of public credibility and trust it is no worse than, and may in fact be better than, an approach that ignores or distracts from risks which people instinctively understand are real.","textSource":"note_tweet","textLength":3283,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1786833884000,"postedAt":"2026-08-15T22:44:44.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":454.7655563888889,"url":"https://x.com/DarioAmodei/status/2088758819304443967","views":11605496,"likes":8976,"reposts":615,"replies":1159,"bookmarks":3091,"quotes":692,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":null,"quotedPost":null,"inReplyToStatusId":"2088758816376807762","inReplyToUserId":"874126509245476864","inReplyToUsername":"DarioAmodei","conversationId":"2088758816376807762","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":1}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":15,"creatorName":"Dario Amodei","creatorHandle":"DarioAmodei","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":639380,"authorHandle":"DarioAmodei","authorUserId":"874126509245476864","authorName":"Dario Amodei","authorFollowersObserved":640368,"authorFollowingObserved":0,"authorPostsObserved":23,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_replies_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:30:40.003Z","id":"2064781785033244851","postType":"reply","text":"Many of these policy ideas have common-sense appeal across the political spectrum, and the sooner we act on them, the sooner everyone shares in AI's benefits.","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":158,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1781117313000,"postedAt":"2026-06-10T18:48:33.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":2042.7019452777777,"url":"https://x.com/DarioAmodei/status/2064781785033244851","views":182124,"likes":643,"reposts":26,"replies":148,"bookmarks":40,"quotes":5,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":null,"quotedPost":null,"inReplyToStatusId":"2064781782877458612","inReplyToUserId":"874126509245476864","inReplyToUsername":"DarioAmodei","conversationId":"2064781775247950326","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":2}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":15,"creatorName":"Dario Amodei","creatorHandle":"DarioAmodei","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":639380,"authorHandle":"DarioAmodei","authorUserId":"874126509245476864","authorName":"Dario Amodei","authorFollowersObserved":640368,"authorFollowingObserved":0,"authorPostsObserved":23,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_replies_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:30:40.003Z","id":"2064781782877458612","postType":"reply","text":"Alongside it, Anthropic is releasing a proposal for how governments can address the risks posed by frontier AI and a policy framework for job displacement, for which we intend to provide substantial financial backing.  https://t.co/P0W2lIKbdY","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":242,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1781117313000,"postedAt":"2026-06-10T18:48:33.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":2042.7019452777777,"url":"https://x.com/DarioAmodei/status/2064781782877458612","views":265936,"likes":775,"reposts":72,"replies":91,"bookmarks":195,"quotes":27,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":["https://www.anthropic.com/policy-on-the-ai-exponential"],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":null,"quotedPost":null,"inReplyToStatusId":"2064781780562137306","inReplyToUserId":"874126509245476864","inReplyToUsername":"DarioAmodei","conversationId":"2064781775247950326","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":3}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":15,"creatorName":"Dario Amodei","creatorHandle":"DarioAmodei","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":639380,"authorHandle":"DarioAmodei","authorUserId":"874126509245476864","authorName":"Dario Amodei","authorFollowersObserved":640368,"authorFollowingObserved":0,"authorPostsObserved":23,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_replies_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:30:40.003Z","id":"2064781780562137306","postType":"reply","text":"The essay also covers what AI’s steep trajectory means for jobs and the economy, scientific progress, civil liberties, and geopolitics.","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":135,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1781117312000,"postedAt":"2026-06-10T18:48:32.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":2042.7022230555556,"url":"https://x.com/DarioAmodei/status/2064781780562137306","views":132246,"likes":557,"reposts":21,"replies":42,"bookmarks":31,"quotes":1,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":null,"quotedPost":null,"inReplyToStatusId":"2064781778599268818","inReplyToUserId":"874126509245476864","inReplyToUsername":"DarioAmodei","conversationId":"2064781775247950326","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":4}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":15,"creatorName":"Dario Amodei","creatorHandle":"DarioAmodei","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":639380,"authorHandle":"DarioAmodei","authorUserId":"874126509245476864","authorName":"Dario Amodei","authorFollowersObserved":640368,"authorFollowingObserved":0,"authorPostsObserved":23,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_replies_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:30:40.003Z","id":"2064781778599268818","postType":"reply","text":"In addition to transparency, I now believe frontier models should face mandatory third-party testing for cyber, bio, and autonomy risks—with the power to block or revoke deployment of models that pose catastrophic risk.","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":219,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1781117312000,"postedAt":"2026-06-10T18:48:32.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":2042.7022230555556,"url":"https://x.com/DarioAmodei/status/2064781778599268818","views":291317,"likes":1104,"reposts":76,"replies":216,"bookmarks":88,"quotes":60,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":null,"quotedPost":null,"inReplyToStatusId":"2064781776904663043","inReplyToUserId":"874126509245476864","inReplyToUsername":"DarioAmodei","conversationId":"2064781775247950326","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":5}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":15,"creatorName":"Dario Amodei","creatorHandle":"DarioAmodei","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":639380,"authorHandle":"DarioAmodei","authorUserId":"874126509245476864","authorName":"Dario Amodei","authorFollowersObserved":640368,"authorFollowingObserved":0,"authorPostsObserved":23,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_search_timeline_replies_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:30:40.003Z","id":"2064781776904663043","postType":"reply","text":"Anthropic has long advocated for transparency requirements for frontier AI, because the risks weren't yet clear enough to regulate precisely. That is no longer sufficient.","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":171,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1781117312000,"postedAt":"2026-06-10T18:48:32.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":2042.7022230555556,"url":"https://x.com/DarioAmodei/status/2064781776904663043","views":297299,"likes":842,"reposts":44,"replies":72,"bookmarks":50,"quotes":9,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":null,"quotedPost":null,"inReplyToStatusId":"2064781775247950326","inReplyToUserId":"874126509245476864","inReplyToUsername":"DarioAmodei","conversationId":"2064781775247950326","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":6}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":15,"creatorName":"Dario Amodei","creatorHandle":"DarioAmodei","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":639380,"authorHandle":"DarioAmodei","authorUserId":"874126509245476864","authorName":"Dario Amodei","authorFollowersObserved":640368,"authorFollowingObserved":0,"authorPostsObserved":23,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_replies_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:30:40.003Z","id":"2041580343472337145","postType":"reply","text":"Cyber is the first clear and present danger from frontier AI models, but it won’t be the last. If we are able to collectively rise to the challenge and confront this risk, it could serve as a blueprint for addressing the even more difficult challenges that lie ahead of us.","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":273,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1775585659000,"postedAt":"2026-04-07T18:14:19.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":3579.272500833333,"url":"https://x.com/DarioAmodei/status/2041580343472337145","views":180125,"likes":986,"reposts":60,"replies":110,"bookmarks":59,"quotes":4,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":null,"quotedPost":null,"inReplyToStatusId":"2041580341794615631","inReplyToUserId":"874126509245476864","inReplyToUsername":"DarioAmodei","conversationId":"2041580334693720511","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":7}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":15,"creatorName":"Dario Amodei","creatorHandle":"DarioAmodei","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":639380,"authorHandle":"DarioAmodei","authorUserId":"874126509245476864","authorName":"Dario Amodei","authorFollowersObserved":640368,"authorFollowingObserved":0,"authorPostsObserved":23,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_replies_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:30:40.003Z","id":"2041580341794615631","postType":"reply","text":"The dangers of getting this wrong are obvious, but if we get it right, there is a real opportunity to create a fundamentally more secure internet and world than we had before the advent of AI-powered cyber capabilities.","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":219,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1775585658000,"postedAt":"2026-04-07T18:14:18.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":3579.2727786111113,"url":"https://x.com/DarioAmodei/status/2041580341794615631","views":260540,"likes":1199,"reposts":82,"replies":123,"bookmarks":79,"quotes":14,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":null,"quotedPost":null,"inReplyToStatusId":"2041580340032995821","inReplyToUserId":"874126509245476864","inReplyToUsername":"DarioAmodei","conversationId":"2041580334693720511","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":8}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":15,"creatorName":"Dario Amodei","creatorHandle":"DarioAmodei","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":639380,"authorHandle":"DarioAmodei","authorUserId":"874126509245476864","authorName":"Dario Amodei","authorFollowersObserved":640368,"authorFollowingObserved":0,"authorPostsObserved":23,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_replies_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:30:40.003Z","id":"2041580340032995821","postType":"reply","text":"Glasswing is just the first step: patching and securing the world’s software infrastructure will be the work of months and years, and will require even broader cooperation across AI companies, cyberdefenders, software providers, governments, and more.","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":251,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1775585658000,"postedAt":"2026-04-07T18:14:18.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":3579.2727786111113,"url":"https://x.com/DarioAmodei/status/2041580340032995821","views":36870,"likes":474,"reposts":21,"replies":16,"bookmarks":18,"quotes":6,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":null,"quotedPost":null,"inReplyToStatusId":"2041580338426585171","inReplyToUserId":"874126509245476864","inReplyToUsername":"DarioAmodei","conversationId":"2041580334693720511","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":9}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":15,"creatorName":"Dario Amodei","creatorHandle":"DarioAmodei","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":639380,"authorHandle":"DarioAmodei","authorUserId":"874126509245476864","authorName":"Dario Amodei","authorFollowersObserved":640368,"authorFollowingObserved":0,"authorPostsObserved":23,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_replies_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:30:40.003Z","id":"2041580338426585171","postType":"reply","text":"Rather than release Mythos Preview to general availability, we’re giving defenders early controlled access in order to find and patch vulnerabilities before Mythos-class models proliferate across the ecosystem.","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":210,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1775585658000,"postedAt":"2026-04-07T18:14:18.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":3579.2727786111113,"url":"https://x.com/DarioAmodei/status/2041580338426585171","views":68452,"likes":1072,"reposts":49,"replies":35,"bookmarks":51,"quotes":21,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":null,"quotedPost":null,"inReplyToStatusId":"2041580336828568000","inReplyToUserId":"874126509245476864","inReplyToUsername":"DarioAmodei","conversationId":"2041580334693720511","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":10}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":15,"creatorName":"Dario Amodei","creatorHandle":"DarioAmodei","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":639380,"authorHandle":"DarioAmodei","authorUserId":"874126509245476864","authorName":"Dario Amodei","authorFollowersObserved":640368,"authorFollowingObserved":0,"authorPostsObserved":23,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_replies_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:30:40.003Z","id":"2041580336828568000","postType":"reply","text":"We’ve been tracking the increasing cyber capabilities of AI models for years, which arise as part of their general proficiency at coding. But our new model, Mythos Preview, represents a particularly large step up.","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":213,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1775585657000,"postedAt":"2026-04-07T18:14:17.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":3579.273056388889,"url":"https://x.com/DarioAmodei/status/2041580336828568000","views":69548,"likes":901,"reposts":32,"replies":23,"bookmarks":15,"quotes":6,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":null,"quotedPost":null,"inReplyToStatusId":"2041580334693720511","inReplyToUserId":"874126509245476864","inReplyToUsername":"DarioAmodei","conversationId":"2041580334693720511","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":11}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":15,"creatorName":"Dario Amodei","creatorHandle":"DarioAmodei","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":639380,"authorHandle":"DarioAmodei","authorUserId":"874126509245476864","authorName":"Dario Amodei","authorFollowersObserved":640368,"authorFollowingObserved":0,"authorPostsObserved":23,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_replies_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:30:40.003Z","id":"2015833051205414955","postType":"reply","text":"I've been working on this essay for a while, and it is mainly about AI and about the future. But given the horror we're seeing in Minnesota, its emphasis on the importance of preserving democratic values and rights at home is particularly relevant.","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":248,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1769447026000,"postedAt":"2026-01-26T17:03:46.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":5284.448334166666,"url":"https://x.com/DarioAmodei/status/2015833051205414955","views":1139277,"likes":6605,"reposts":405,"replies":293,"bookmarks":682,"quotes":100,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":null,"quotedPost":null,"inReplyToStatusId":"2015833048785248440","inReplyToUserId":"874126509245476864","inReplyToUsername":"DarioAmodei","conversationId":"2015833046327402527","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":12}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":15,"creatorName":"Dario Amodei","creatorHandle":"DarioAmodei","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":639380,"authorHandle":"DarioAmodei","authorUserId":"874126509245476864","authorName":"Dario Amodei","authorFollowersObserved":640368,"authorFollowingObserved":0,"authorPostsObserved":23,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_replies_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:30:40.003Z","id":"2015833048785248440","postType":"reply","text":"It's a companion to Machines of Loving Grace, an essay I wrote over a year ago, which focused on what powerful AI could achieve if we get it right: https://t.co/TDKfXIPw15","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":171,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1769447025000,"postedAt":"2026-01-26T17:03:45.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":5284.448611944445,"url":"https://x.com/DarioAmodei/status/2015833048785248440","views":861787,"likes":2420,"reposts":228,"replies":159,"bookmarks":1481,"quotes":26,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":["https://www.darioamodei.com/essay/machines-of-loving-grace"],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":null,"quotedPost":null,"inReplyToStatusId":"2015833046327402527","inReplyToUserId":"874126509245476864","inReplyToUsername":"DarioAmodei","conversationId":"2015833046327402527","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":13}
